<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Elan started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Elan started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>--Vector Securities analyst Patricia Bank said she started Elan Corp Plc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>--Shares in the drug delivery systems company were up 1/8 to 34-1/8.</p>
<p>--&quot;The company's position has been greatly enhanced by the Athena (Neurosciences) acquisition in that we believe ELN can generate, on average, 25-percent EPS growth over the next several years,&quot; Bank said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
